Modifications
-------------

The vendored kernels are adapted minimally for moeflux's weight format.
Every change to a vendored file is marked inline with a `moeflux-mlx:`
comment so it is distinguishable from upstream MLX code. The principal
adaptation is a `ScaleT` template parameter on the quantized block loader
so it reads bf16 scales/biases while accumulating in f32.
